<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>JALAO GAMING | Friendship</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #090909;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
}

header {
    padding: 30px 15px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #151515, #382700);
    border-bottom: 2px solid #ffbf00;
}

header h1 {
    color: #ffbf00;
    font-size: 30px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

header p {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: #ddd;
}

.friendship {
    padding: 25px 12px;
}

.friendship h2 {
    color: #ffbf00;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.friendship p {
    color: #ccc;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

.cards {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 20px 12px 35px;
}

.card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 320px;
    background: #171717;
    border: 1px solid #b88919;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px #ffbf0015;
}

.card img {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
}

.card-content {
    padding: 20px;
}

.card h3 {
    color: #ffbf00;
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.stats {
    color: #ddd;
    line-height: 1.9;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.badge {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 15px;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border: 1px solid #ffbf00;
    border-radius: 20px;
    color: #ffbf00;
}

.heart {
    color: #ffbf00;
    font-size: 30px;
    margin: 5px;
}

.message {
    margin: 10px 15px 35px;
    padding: 25px 15px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #151515;
    border: 1px solid #333;
}

.message h2 {
    color: #ffbf00;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.message p {
    color: #ddd;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

footer {
    padding: 20px 10px;
    color: #999;
    background: #111;
    border-top: 1px solid #333;
    font-size: 13px;
}

@media (min-width: 700px) {
    header h1 {
        font-size: 38px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>JALAO GAMING</h1>
    <p>FREE FIRE FRIENDSHIP</p>
</header>

<section class="friendship">
    <h2>दोस्ती अपनी, गेम अपना! 🎮</h2>
    <p>दो अलग-अलग प्रोफाइल, लेकिन यादें और दोस्ती एक।</p>
</section>

<section class="cards">

    <!-- JALAO GAMING PROFILE -->
    <div class="card">
        <img src="jalao.png" alt="JALAO GAMING Free Fire Profile">

        <div class="card-content">
            <h3>JALAO GAMING</h3>

            <div class="stats">
                🎮 Level: 65<br>
                👍 Likes: 20,614<br>
                🏆 Clash Squad: 539
            </div>

            <span class="badge">GAMING PARTNER</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="heart">🤝</div>

    <!-- FRIEND PROFILE -->
    <div class="card">
        <img src="friend.png" alt="Friend Free Fire Profile">

        <div class="card-content">
            <h3>JALAO ANTIM</h3>

            <div class="stats">
                🎮 Level: 52<br>
                👍 Likes: 13,353<br>
                🏆 Clash Squad: 539
            </div>

            <span class="badge">FOREVER FRIENDS</span>
        </div>
    </div>

</section>

<section class="message">
    <h2>हमारी दोस्ती ❤️</h2>
    <p>
        गेम में मुकाबला हो सकता है,<br>
        लेकिन दोस्ती में कोई मुकाबला नहीं।<br>
        <strong>JALAO GAMING × FRIENDSHIP</strong><br>
        साथ खेलेंगे, साथ आगे बढ़ेंगे!
    </p>
</section>

<footer>
    © 2026 JALAO GAMING | Made for Friendship
</footer>

</body>
</html>